#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deterministic reporting for Creditoparaveiculo account 13.

Modes:
- daily: 07:00 reports the previous closed day; 08:00/12:00/14:00/16:00/20:00 report the current day.
- intraday: current-day read-only checkpoint, posted to the fixed Intraday thread.
- reactivate: reactivates only temporary 16:00 guardrail pauses due at 00:30.
- snapshot: local continuity snapshot, no Discord post.

No LLM is used. Secrets are resolved in process and never logged.
"""
